Package: portion
Type: Package
Title: Extracting a Data Portion
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Lennart", "Oelschl\u00e4ger", email = "oelschlaeger.lennart@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts a portion of the data in vectors, matrices, data frames,
    time series, and lists of these objects. The size of the portion is given
    relative to the size of the object. The portion can consist of the first,
    the last, random, similar, or dissimilar elements, rows, or columns.
